{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"runkin_clubber","model_identifier":"runkin_clubber","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# runkin_clubber\n\nRunkin clubber (A2), fighter, 1.5 m = 53 u (hair to 54).\n\nRunkin warrior: bare painted arms and chest, red eye-band face paint with white dots, bone-and-fang necklace, a hide baldric strap, fur on the right shoulder, fringed hide kilt and leggings, and a heavy knobbed hardwood club. A flint war spear is included as a hidden alternative in the same slot. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..9.0, y 0.0..56.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | club cocked over the right shoulder, left hand forward (loop) |\n| `swing` | 0.9 | once | key 0.38 s: club head strikes (wind-up high behind the right shoulder 0.22 s, wide diagonal arc down and across, follow-through low left 0.52 s) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | club hanging in the right hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swing`: key 0.38 s: club head strikes (wind-up high behind the right shoulder 0.22 s, wide diagonal arc down and across, follow-through low left 0.52 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hardwood_club` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 0.75 m (26 u), knobbed head along -Z, sinew-wrapped grip at the origin\n- `flint_spear` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): flint war spear 1.8 m (64 u) as the alternative weapon; reuse guard/swing timings or the A2 spear thrust if wanted\n\n## Notes\n\n- The arc of the swing: grip travels from above the right shoulder (behind) to in front of the chest (key) to the left hip; useful for a sweep hit test.\n"},"description":"# runkin_clubber\n\nRunkin clubber (A2), fighter, 1.5 m = 53 u (hair to 54).\n\nRunkin warrior: bare painted arms and chest, red eye-band face paint with white dots, bone-and-fang necklace, a hide baldric strap, fur on the right shoulder, fringed hide kilt and leggings, and a heavy knobbed hardwood club. A flint war spear is included as a hidden alternative in the same slot. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 34 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -8.5..9.0, y 0.0..56.0, z -5.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 18 x 54 x 12 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `guard` | 2 | loop | club cocked over the right shoulder, left hand forward (loop) |\n| `swing` | 0.9 | once | key 0.38 s: club head strikes (wind-up high behind the right shoulder 0.22 s, wide diagonal arc down and across, follow-through low left 0.52 s) |\n| `idle` | 3.4 | loop | club hanging in the right hand |\n| `walk` | 0.85 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.52 | loop |  |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.3 | hold | falls on the back, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 0.85 s\n- `run`: 142.2 u/s (4.00 m/s), cycle 0.52 s\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swing`: key 0.38 s: club head strikes (wind-up high behind the right shoulder 0.22 s, wide diagonal arc down and across, follow-through low left 0.52 s)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 53, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 37, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 40, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 44.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 35.5, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 28.75, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 22.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (6, 29, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-6, 29, 2.5)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `hardwood_club` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 0.75 m (26 u), knobbed head along -Z, sinew-wrapped grip at the origin\n- `flint_spear` (hidden preview, under slot_hand_r): flint war spear 1.8 m (64 u) as the alternative weapon; reuse guard/swing timings or the A2 spear thrust if wanted\n\n## Notes\n\n- The arc of the swing: grip travels from above the right shoulder (behind) to in front of the chest (key) to the left hip; useful for a sweep hit test.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.0,26.0,-3.0],"to":[5.0,30.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,26.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[11,77,21.0,81.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[31,77,37.0,81.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[21,77,31.0,81.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[37,77,43.0,81.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[101,70,111.0,76.0],"texture":0},"